    "notes": "H10. Six actual stages each facing: prepare, whole spear pin against small basalt support, anatomical LEFT shield screen, final contact truly hidden by opaque shield, effortful withdrawal, threat check and fold. QA independently approved all selected steps. Cropped right03b3 and unsafe originalA lower rows excluded. One spear, left shield stable, no projectile/gore or victory substitution. Gray articulated adult-sized mannequin and basalt are explicit scene-study stand-ins baked into these images: no real narrative victim, independent opponent synchronization, fatality input, lifecycle or duel binding implemented. Native spear-head detail varies between independently authored views; exact canon set/victim not certified. Fixed reviewed Feral body references and manually reviewed Feral-foot baselines exclude mannequin/slab feet. Calibrations are excluded; playback durations are for visual inspection, not source mechanics."
